Package: koyomi
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: uchmk <uchmk@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), systemd (>= 252), init-system-helpers (>= 1.54), passwd
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/uchmk/koyomi
Description: small job scheduler and monitor (engine)
 koyomi runs scheduled jobs and watches them. This package installs the
 engine as a systemd service, with an HTTPS endpoint that the koyomi
 screen on Windows connects to.
